Project 04 – Web Scraper for Headlines & Quotes

I developed a Python web scraper using Requests and BeautifulSoup.

The application collects quotes, author names and tags from Quotes to Scrape, a public website designed for scraping practice.

The collected data is saved in JSON and TXT formats. The program also displays the total number of quotes, the most quoted author and the most common tag.

Source chosen: https://quotes.toscrape.com

Why this source: It is a public practice website specifically designed for learning web scraping.

Politeness rules: The scraper uses a request timeout and a one-second delay between page requests.
